{
  "slug": "notion-markdown-sync",
  "name": "Notion Markdown Sync",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Two-way markdown sync for Notion — push, pull, and round-trip local markdown files with Notion pages via the Markdown API. Auto-detects GFM vs Notion format, handles media uploads/downloads, icon replication, and database page properties.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `notion-markdown-sync` (Two-way sync between local markdown files and Notion pages using the Notion Markdown API (v2026-03-11)).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install notion-markdown-sync@claude-community` from `VegaStack/oss-notion-markdown-sync`.\n\nTwo-way markdown sync for Notion. Push local markdown files to Notion pages, pull Notion pages to local markdown, and keep them in sync — all through the Notion Markdown API.",
